cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this resource, please cite it as below. It is an educational compliance
  reference and is not legal advice.
title: "DPDP Act 2023 Reference and the dpdp-analyze skill"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Verbatim, section-by-section text of India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023
  (Act No. 22 of 2023), a reference to the Digital Personal Data Protection Rules, 2025, a
  78-point compliance checklist, and dpdp-analyze, an open-source Agent Skill for Claude Code
  that analyses privacy notices, consent flows, vendor contracts and products against the Act,
  citing a section or rule for every claim.
authors:
  - given-names: Mayank
    family-names: Dsouza
repository-code: "https://github.com/mksd0398/dpdp-act-skill"
url: "https://mksd0398.github.io/dpdp-act-skill/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - DPDP Act 2023
  - Digital Personal Data Protection Act
  - DPDP Rules 2025
  - India data protection law
  - privacy compliance
  - Claude Code skill
  - Agent Skills
